# Optional settings. Copy this file to .env (it is git-ignored).
#
# The pipeline calls Claude through the Claude Code CLI on your subscription: NO API key is needed.
# Do NOT set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY - with a key present, Claude Code would bill the API instead
# (the pipeline strips it from every call and warns if it finds one).
#
# Only needed if `claude` is not on your PATH:
# CLAUDE_CLI=C:/Users/<you>/.local/bin/claude.exe
